        <div class="re-challenges-grid">
          <div class="re-challenge-card">
            <div class="re-ch-icon">⚠️</div>
            <h3>Manual Property Management</h3>
            <p>Disconnected inventory tracking leads to double bookings, inaccurate unit availability, and delayed unit releases.</p>
            <div class="re-ch-solution">
              <span>Solution:</span> Centralized real-time inventory engine across all sites and sales teams.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="re-challenge-card">
            <div class="re-ch-icon">📉</div>
            <h3>Lost Sales Leads</h3>
            <p>Unorganized lead capture from websites, portals, and brokers results in missed buyer follow-ups and lost revenue.</p>
            <div class="re-ch-solution">
              <span>Solution:</span> Automated lead routing, instant WhatsApp triggers, and pipeline tracking.
