          <div class="re-challenge-card">
            <div class="re-ch-icon">📄</div>
            <h3>Complex Contract Management</h3>
            <p>Managing allotment letters, legal contracts, and payment installment schedules manually slows down closings.</p>
            <div class="re-ch-solution">
              <span>Solution:</span> Digital contract generator with e-signature and milestone-linked payment plans.
