                    <li><span>Residential Properties</span> – High-rise apartments, villas, townhouses</li>
                    <li><span>Commercial Properties</span> – Office spaces, retail hubs, tech parks</li>
                    <li><span>Land Management</span> – Plot layout mapping, land bank tracking</li>
